  "id": "figural-aftereffect",
  "term": "figural aftereffect",
  "definition": "Figural aftereffect is a perceptual phenomenon in which what happens in one part of the perceptual field changes how another part is perceived. It has been used in Gestalt psychology to show that perception is influenced by relationships across the whole field.",
